<title>USA: TCF Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TCF Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.83		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net			 28,931		   26,287</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	34,797		   35,986</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	35,216		   36,417</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results include $877,000 gain on sale of loans, $1,369,000 gain on sale of securities and $1,622,000 gain on sale of loan servicing.  </p>
<p>Q1 1996 results include $1,483,000 gain on sale of loans, $85,000 gain on sale of securities and $1,245,000 gain on sale of branches.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net interest income $86.0 million vs $84.5 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 total non-interest income $40.4 million vs $35.8 million.</p>
<p>Assets $6.96 billion vs $7.0 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $5.29 billion vs $5.15 billion</p>
<p>Net loans $4.96 billion vs $5.11 billion</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
